==Portuguese==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Brazil (Rio)}} {{IPA|/poʁ.ˈke/|lang=pt}}
* {{a|Brazil (Caipira)}} {{IPA|/puɹ.ˈke/|lang=pt}}
* {{a|Portugal}} {{IPA|/puɾ.ˈkɨ/|lang=pt}}
* {{hyphenation|por|que|lang=pt}}

===Etymology===
{{compound|por|que|lang=pt}}. From {{etyl|roa-opt|pt}} {{m|roa-opt|porque}}. Cognate with Galician {{m|gl|porque}}, Spanish {{m|es|porque}}, Catalan {{m|ca|perquè}}, French {{m|fr|parce que}} and Italian {{m|it|perché}}.

===Conjunction===
{{head|pt|conjunction}}

# {{l|en|because}}, {{l|en|for}} {{gloss|introduces an explanation to the question in the previous sentence}}
#: {{usex|lang=pt|Aproveita tua vida '''porque''' ela é curta!|Enjoy your life because it is short!}}

====Related terms====
