==Spanish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈpoɾ.ke/|lang=es}}

===Etymology===
From {{term|por|lang=es}} + {{term|que|lang=es}}.

===Conjunction===
{{head|es|conjunction}}

# [[because]]

====Usage notes====
* The subordinate clause that {{term||porque|lang=es}} introduces is most often in the indicative.
* When {{term||porque|lang=es}} is negated — when one thing is said ''not'' to be because of another — its subordinate clause is in the subjunctive.

====Related terms====
